emoji: 🧮
name: Memory caps
group: core
what: Memory limits for Whisper (dictation), scrcpy (Android Mirror) and VSCodium, adjustable in one file.
why: One runaway app can use up the Frame's memory and stall VR. systemd caps an app per process group, without root.
changes: `~/.local/bin/capped`, `~/.config/frame-tweaks/memcap.conf`, a systemd drop-in for VSCodium's Flatpak scope
access: Starts capped apps in their own systemd scope
survives-updates: Yes (everything is in your home folder)
undo: `./install.sh uninstall memcap` (keeps your limits file)
